    "created_at": "2017-01-26T00:22:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-26T00:22:54Z",
    "body": "Putting it in the `lt` means you'll have to do contortions to make it autolink as well. It's not a route you want to go.\r\n\r\nPrivate slots don't occupy the same namespace as normal attributes/methods, and it's apparently common to give them the same names as existing attributes/methods (or else I wouldn't have had to add special logic to make the IDs generate differently), so if you *don't* include the []s, you have to manually disambiguate by type more.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
