    "created_at": "2017-01-26T00:25:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-26T00:25:57Z",
    "body": "In the end we don't generally let our tools govern our style, so we want to figure out which style we want, as an independent decision from which style Bikeshed wants. It's been painful when those come into conflict in the past, but at least this time there are workarounds.",
