    "updated_at": "2017-01-26T15:59:36Z",
    "body": "The test document used in https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/issues/894 didn't actually quite fit this use case.\r\n\r\nThe example used\r\n\r\n     <dfn method for=\"platform objects\">\\[[Transfer]]()</dfn>\r\n\r\nBut the HTML spec currently has\r\n\r\n      <p>[[<dfn>Transfer</dfn>]] ( <var>targetRealm</var> )</p>\r\n\r\n<s>It's hard to put the () inside the `dfn` tags if () is also being used to list its arguments. Or is everything in between the () ignored?</s> [It does ignore arguments defined between parentheses](https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/commit/df49e33dde210f39fbed7482dd15213e1a8b5bea), though it looks like it requires no whitespace between the function name and (.",
