    "body": "I was gonna do a separate PR for moving all the other internal slots definitions to the new style, aside from the two that have a line break inside the tag it's just\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nsed -e 's/\\[\\[\\(<dfn[^>]*>\\)\\([^<]*\\)<\\/dfn>\\]\\]/\\1[[\\2]]<\\/dfn>/g' -i source\r\nsed -e 's/\\[\\[\\(<span[^>]*>\\)\\([^<]*\\)<\\/span>\\]\\]/\\1[[\\2]]<\\/span>/g' -i source\r\n```",
